        "description": "# 🪐 In a world where gravity is no longer a limitation, the Gravity League has become the ultimate test of skill and endurance for athletes from all corners of the galaxy \n\n**🏅 The rules are simple: 2 players, 1 ball, zero gravity - the first player to 11 goals wins**\n\n{1354939542135630}\n\n**🤺 Compete in the Online League against opponents from across the galaxy!**\n\n{1976362319502049}\n\n**🏆 Climb to the top league in the epic Solo Campaign!**\n\n{1107966613999876}\n\n**😮 Face off against legendary bosses in the Gravity Hall of Fame!**\n\n{929405105746054}\n\n**🤜🤛 Challenge your friends in exciting custom private matches!**\n\n{1913411985805921}\n\n**🥳 Dive into our wild and wacky party modes!**\n\n{543306305097715}\n\n**🎁 Play minigames and score epic prizes!**\n\n{571183892111623}\n\n**✊✊ Team up with your friends for a 2v2 action**\n\n{7650100731760246}\n\n**Main Features:**\n\nOnline League – Compete in ranked or unranked matches and prove your skills\nSolo Campaign – Climb from the Regional League to the top of the Gravity League.\nParty Modes – Challenge friends in four fun and chaotic game modes\nSolo Mode – Take on Grax across multiple AI difficulty levels\nRanking System – Level up to 100 and unlock exciting rewards along the way\nVibrant Discord Community – Join the server for secret challenges, tournaments, and to connect with other players\nMinigames – Play for a chance to win awesome prizes in Gravity's mini-games\n\n**It’s time to strap on your Gravity Gloves and get ready to take on the competition!** 🫡",
